  "historyNote": "#1169, eff 5-23-78; ss by #2154, eff 10-11-82; ss by #2822, eff 8-17-84; ss by #5300, eff 12-26-91; ss by #6691, eff 2-21-98, EXPIRED: 2-21-06 New. #8579, eff 3-8-06; ss by #10665, eff 9-9-14; amd by #10882, eff 7-11-15; amd by #11022, eff 1-21-16; ss by 14071, eff 9-10-24",
